# Alternative parameter file: a direct transcription from the textbook.
DATAFILE
mr42a.dat
NUMBER_OF_TRAITS
1
NUMBER_OF_EFFECTS
2
OBSERVATION(S)
5
WEIGHT(S)

EFFECTS:
2 2 cross
3 4 cross               # 3rd column = sire effect; 4 sires
